 gates pass |
| publish deep results | 1 min | — |

The publish stage writes a **manifest** (model, recipe, plan hash, kernel versions, tuning DB hash, exactness mode, gates, benchmarks, localeval scores, commit) and a **unanimis** report. The manifest is the single source of truth for reproducibility.

## 8. Server, APIs, UI, metrics

- **OpenAI**: `/v1/chat/completions`, `/v1/completions`, `/v1/responses`, `/v1/models` (list, retrieve, list_families).

